    "description":  "\u003cdiv class=\"tabset\"\u003e\u003cdiv id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"tab-title\"\u003eDescription\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"tab-content\"\u003e\u003cp\u003eYou can now reach really far to open doors and containers, as well as picking up loot!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHelps to scrub in those hard to reach areas!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConfig Options:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- Loot/Container Interaction Distance: How far away you can open containers and pickup loot.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- Door Interaction Distance: How far away you can open doors from.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eInstallation Instructions\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- unzip the file into your SPT Game folder.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"tab-title\"\u003eSupport My Work\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"tab-content\"\u003e\u003cp\u003eNever feel obligated to donate for support.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/mattdokn\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ehttps://ko-fi.com/mattdokn\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n",
